          <definition> To develop a craving for.</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠲᠠᠩᠰᠣᠬ ᠎ᠲᠤᠷ ᠲᠠᠰᠢᠭᠤᠷᠠᠬᠤ</unicode>
          <transcript>-- tur tasiγuraxu</transcript>
